  "method": "Stress = utilisation / days-of-stock, where utilisation is live demand against AVAILABLE thermal capacity (fleet minus units out), scaled 0-100 across the states we can score. Both terms are ratios, so neither carries the seasonal level that broke an earlier z-score construction \u2014 that version scored +0.204 against national cap-share where raw demand alone scored +0.548, because available capacity is a summer proxy in India and a z-score sum encodes that as causation.",
